N/NW. ECHO-2'S PRIMARY OBJECTIVE WILL BE AS SECURITY FOR 1ST PLT, 
CLEARING THE FIELD OF ENEMY UNITS.

HOWEVER, SHOULD 1ST PLT FIND ITSELF UNABLE TO COMPLETE IT'S MISSION
